@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@contentType = application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION (Run this first to get a token)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "super@assettrust.gov",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Save Token (If using VS Code REST Client)
@token = {{loginRequest.response.body.data.token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. ASSETS
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### Get all assets
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a single asset by ID (Replace ID with a real one from above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets/cm1ln0sxg0000y1n7h6b5b5b5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a new asset
POST {{baseUrl}}/assets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Backup Generator XYZ",
  "assetId": "GEN-9901",
  "category": "FACILITY",
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "latitude": 21.17,
  "longitude": 72.83,
  "purchaseCost": 50000,
  "healthScore": 100
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. WORK ORDERS
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### Get all work orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a new work order
POST {{baseUrl}}/work-orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Routine Inspection for Generator",
  "description": "Check oil levels and battery.",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "assetId": "cm1ln0sxg0000y1n7h6b5b5b5" 
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. AUDIT & HASH CHAIN
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### Get the audit log (Shows Who did What)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verify Cryptographic Hash Chain
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ANOMALIES (AI ALERTS)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### Get active anomalies
GET {{baseUrl}}/anomalies?isResolved=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
